WEBVTT

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:54.150
I have brought her.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.340
Master?

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:25.050
Who ordered you to set the ground ablaze?

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.310
Forget about the Sinner!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:32.270
Don't forget that as long as
those chains exist, you cannot defy me.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:37.360
All you need to do is carry out my orders.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.360
As you wish.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:02.170
Servant of Fatima, this is your final stage.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.470
Final?

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:06.350
That which my body lacks...

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.560
You will bring life back to it.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:24.780
Rosette!

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.620
Are you all right?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.910
Thank goodness.

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.250
Everyone...

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.120
Where's Chrono?

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.960
It looks like you've come to.

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:43.340
These enemies seem to be
in a completely different league

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:45.300
from those we have faced up until now.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.050
Chrono...

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:51.220
Rosette, I'm sorry.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:56.150
I think I've been avoiding you
since I learned about Chrono.

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:58.480
Me too.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.280
It's all right, it doesn't bother me.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.280
But...

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:10.030
After all, he's different from the rest of us.

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:11.950
It's natural to be afraid.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.710
Oww...

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:17.080
Rosette, are you all right?!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.840
No, you mustn't move yet!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.430
This is no time to be saying that.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:34.810
Chrono...

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:40.940
Don't...

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.280
But...

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.490
But Azmaria...

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:54.290
She was smiling.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.880
Once again, we weren't able to do anything!

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:09.640
You're the only one that
can save Azmaria right now!

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:13.560
If you can use your power,
then even those injuries will heal quickly!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.730
And then you could...

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.850
If I use my power, then your life...

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:22.690
I don't care! I want to save Azmaria.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.230
There's something I want to tell her.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:28.860
So please, please, Chrono!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:35.450
The source of his power is
the very soul of his contractor.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.580
Rosette...

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:51.050
This body was blown to
little bits in that loathsome war.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.680
But I can't die.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.980
Thanks to my pact of undeath
with my contractor, Lerajie,

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.770
my physical body came back.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:06.070
But it wasn't complete.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:10.030
What this body lacks is life.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:14.070
Because of this, I am rotting.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:25.250
It is because the power of
the contractor, Lerajie, was imperfect,

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:29.510
even though at one time, there was
nothing beyond Lerajie's capabilities.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:35.180
The one that reduced
my power is the Sinner, Chrono.

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:36.260
Chrono?!

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:45.560
You will open the gate to Heaven for us.

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:50.740
Servant of Fatima... no, Apostle,

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:55.570
no matter what it takes,
the contract must be fulfilled.

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.700
If in order to call back my master's life,

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.910
the power of a devil is imperfect,

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.870
then we will use
the power of one who is perfect.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.000
In other words, the power of God!

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:12.050
We will begin the ceremony.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:14.130
Servant of Fatima,

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:18.310
illuminate us with the miracle that
was entrusted to you by the Virgin Mary.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:22.980
Come, let us hear
the singing voice that gives praise to God.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:46.830
What's that light?

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:53.050
The Astral Line.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.930
It can't be!

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:59.220
The Apostles' purpose is
to manipulate the Astral Line?

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:01.970
What's the Astral Line?

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:06.520
It is the gathering of an enormous amount
of spiritual energy, high above the ground.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:11.480
A giant cycle of the Astral,
fashioned after the souls of living beings.

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:15.900
Living things, as they are born,
receive their life from here,

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:20.740
and the souls of the dead return in order
to once again become a drop in the river.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.830
The source of all life.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:30.920
What is God trying to make Azmaria do?!

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:43.140
That's it! Scream even more!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:46.730
The Astral that your voice has summoned

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:51.570
is lighting the fires of life
in this rotting body of mine!

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:58.110
What do you mean, no?

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:01.120
The preparations for the plane
should have been finished ages ago!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.330
That can't be...

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.080
Please, Chrono!

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:12.340
I don't want Azmaria
to have such a pained face.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.460
You feel the same, don't you, Chrono?

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.090
Don't throw your life away so easily.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:21.430
The longer you hesitate,
the harder it is on everyone!

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:24.390
Chrono!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.690
Only for ten minutes.

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:35.610
Chrono...

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.520
L-Lerajie!

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.560
That's enough.

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.230
Why have you stopped it?

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:04.280
Thank you very much for all of the hard work,
for such a long period of time, Master.

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:11.620
This plan wasn't to
bring your life back to you.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.000
A receptor!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:18.800
Exactly, one made so that all of
the Astral would be gathered into it!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.460
Bastard!

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:25.260
It's flowing into it.

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:29.010
The radiance of the Astral,
that holds the blessings of God!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:33.060
I'm going to break these chains, Master!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:36.610
Lerajie!

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.400
And with this, I'm free!

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:50.080
How are your injuries?

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.620
Don't worry.

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.290
We're through the clouds.

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.790
Azmaria!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:11.680
Lerajie!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.560
What is he?

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.310
A Pursuer.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.480
Azmaria!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:23.280
There are still ways
in which the Apostle can be used.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.780
I won't hand her over to Aion or anyone else!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.660
You know, don't you, Sinner?

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.620
If Aion saw you, one who
has become the dog of God,

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.750
I wonder what he would think?

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.090
Aion...

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:45.670
Rosette, you save Azmaria.
I'll take care of Lerajie.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:48.180
But...

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:54.180
Right now, the only living humans
on this ship are you and Azmaria.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.310
Then what are they?

00:13:56.310 --> 00:14:00.310
Legion, low-class
horde devils that mimic people.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:03.690
I'll be taking your head, Chrono!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:07.450
If I do that, then an
even greater rank shall be mine!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.330
Quickly, get the Apostle out of here!

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.590
Azmaria...

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.800
It's losing altitude.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.020
You're not as strong as you used to be.

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.850
Did becoming the dog of God
involve getting your fangs pulled?

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:46.360
I haven't been wanting to use my power.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.990
Those eyes, that voice...

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:55.160
Has the loathsome shadow, that once
struck fear in the devil world, been crushed?

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:01.710
How much did you lose besides your rank?

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:04.290
Actually, I gained much more!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:14.970
Azmaria! Get down!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.440
Rosette!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.480
Thank you.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:30.070
Are you all right? Are you hurt?

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.740
What about you, Rosette?

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:40.750
Is that really Chrono?

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.630
That's right.

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:45.090
The Sinner,Chrono...

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:48.510
The Broken Horn,
the one stripped of his rank...

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:52.130
He's called many things, but he's a devil.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.090
A devil?!

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:58.270
He doesn't look like one,
does he? It's thanks to this seal.

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:03.350
This has the ability
to suppress Chrono's power.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:10.530
Chrono uses the soul... the life span
of his contractor as his nourishment.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.610
That's why, the more he uses his power,

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:16.280
the shorter the life of his contractor becomes.

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:18.700
That life isn't...

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:20.700
Probably...

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.960
I won't live to see thirty.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.140
How?

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:37.220
How can you go that far?

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:43.270
Reducing your life... Ending up like this...

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.690
Okay, then, I'll ask you.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:51.650
Why did you give up so easily?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.280
I don't like that kind of thing.

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:03.290
"I have no choice," or "I'm unlucky,"
or "embrace the pain and tolerate it."

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:06.830
I don't know what's
going to happen in the future.

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:10.420
I don't know, which is why
I don't want to postpone things.

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:13.630
Right now, I have to do what I can.

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:18.680
I don't want to stop
struggling until the very end.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:27.940
This is the power of God!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:32.730
I made a promise to her.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:35.240
Your contractor?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.070
I have a mission!

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:39.570
Until the day I fulfill that promise,

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:43.200
I can't let you bastards take my head!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:49.710
Let me return your power to you!

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.720
Are you worried about your contractor?

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:59.050
I can hear her breathing.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:03.060
How much longer until the appointed time?

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.610
Rosette! Don't come out here!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:24.240
Allow me to erase
your attachments and worries!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:25.950
Stop!

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.970
Who did that?!

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.110
Bastards!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.940
You underestimate the humans!

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:11.500
Azmaria!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:31.190
Right now, I have to do what I can.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.140
Your power...

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.980
...can't be used anymore?

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:18.190
It looks like I used
my power too much, too quickly.

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:21.490
There you go.

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:25.570
It may take time until I can
recover back to how I was before.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:30.620
It might take a month,
half a year, or possibly even longer.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:38.630
My reason for staying here
has gone away, hasn't it?

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:42.880
I wonder where I should go?

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.050
Listen...

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:48.760
There's an opening in the choir, they say.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:50.180
You've got to be ten years old.

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.180
And if you can sing well,
then there's no problem.

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:56.060
So long as it's your decision
to come, we'd welcome you at any time.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:57.230
How's that sound?
